{"id":"U45","weight":"not_kept","settled":"ambiguous","lines":["供给与投入：能做出多少、成本多少","要说得出它通过需求、供给、竞争、定价这类路径动了在研公司的哪个问题"],"settle_with":"Specify whether planned power for a supplier-region industrial cluster is evidence of Nvidia’s supply when no effect on its memory availability or cost is stated.","reason":"The cluster includes Nvidia memory suppliers, but the planned LNG units alone do not establish an effect on Nvidia’s supply (glossary 七类驱动, 5.3 别家公司)."}
