{"id":"U51","weight":"not_kept","settled":"clear","lines":["要说得出它通过需求、供给、竞争、定价这类路径动了在研公司的哪个问题","只因同一篇文章、同一场活动或同一个生态挨着的，不收"],"settle_with":"","reason":"AMS-Osram’s early interconnect development is not tied to an Nvidia purchase, supply constraint, competitor product, or other identifiable effect on Nvidia (5.3 别家公司)."}
